{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long x, y, n;\n    scanf(\"%lld%lld%lld\", &x, &y, &n);\n    \n    if (y <= n) {\n        long long g = __gcd(x, y);\n        printf(\"%lld/%lld\", x / g, y / g);\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    long long best_num = -1, best_den = 1;\n    for (long long i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        long long j = (i * x + y / 2) / y; // rounded to nearest integer\n        if (j * y > i * x) j--;\n        \n        long long num1 = j, den1 = i;\n        long long num2 = j + 1, den2 = i;\n        \n        long long diff1 = abs(i * x - num1 * y);\n        long long diff2 = abs(i * x - num2 * y);\n        \n        if (diff2 < diff1) {\n            num1 = num2;\n            den1 = den2;\n        }\n        \n        if (best_num == -1 || \n            diff1 * best_den < abs(best_num * y - best_den * x) * den1) {\n            best_num = num1;\n            best_den = den1;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    printf(\"%lld/%lld\", best_num, best_den);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] input = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        long x = Long.parseLong(input[0]);\n        long y = Long.parseLong(input[1]);\n        long n = Long.parseLong(input[2]);\n        \n        if (y <= n) {\n            long g = gcd(x, y);\n            System.out.println((x / g) + \"/\" + (y / g));\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        long best_num = -1;\n        long best_den = 1;\n        \n        for (long i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            long j = (i * x + y / 2) / y; // rounded to nearest integer\n            if (j * y > i * x) j--;\n            \n            long num1 = j, den1 = i;\n            long num2 = j + 1, den2 = i;\n            \n            long diff1 = Math.abs(i * x - num1 * y);\n            long diff2 = Math.abs(i * x - num2 * y);\n            \n            if (diff2 < diff1) {\n                num1 = num2;\n                den1 = den2;\n            }\n            \n            if (best_num == -1 || \n                diff1 * best_den < Math.abs(best_num * y - best_den * x) * den1) {\n                best_num = num1;\n                best_den = den1;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(best_num + \"/\" + best_den);\n    }\n    \n    public static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        if (b == 0) return a;\n        return gcd(b, a % b);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001234931987710297, -5.006777428206988e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.00015770144818816334, -6.794906312279636e-06, -0.00877417903393507, -0.24187485873699188, -0.00039498155820183456, -1.3232143828645349e-05, -0.015633760020136833, -0.00024196557933464646, -1.2278481335670222e-05, -1